{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49804","headline":"归国谣 二 · 冯延巳","name":"归国谣 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春艳艳，江上晚山三四点。\n柳丝如剪花如染，香闺寂寂门半掩。\n愁眉歛，泪珠滴破臙脂脸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}